# weightless: the saved game the weightwrap session (DOS's golden) starts from. A new character,
# as the newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): a taper (0x93, 0.4 stones) into the pack, a
# shortsword (0x004, 1.6 stones) at the player's feet, and the carried weight set to 0, as a
# saved game edited elsewhere can hold it while the pack holds the taper. Saved in slot I,
# described "weightless"
9000 key esc
12000 key esc
15000 key enter        # Create Character
18000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
20000 key enter        # the difficulty
22000 key enter
24000 key enter
26000 key enter
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key a            # the name
34200 key v
34400 key a
34600 key t
34800 key a
35000 key r
36000 key enter
38000 key enter        # Yes
44000 cheat give 0x93
44100 cheat give 0x004 drop
44200 cheat set weight 0
47000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "weightless"
47100 key s
47300 up ctrl
49000 key enter
50500 key w
50700 key e
50900 key i
51100 key g
51300 key h
51500 key t
51700 key l
51900 key e
52100 key s
52300 key s
53500 key enter
